5. Automated Reminder Script (time + datetime + file)
Goal:
Simulate a simple reminder system that reads from reminders.txt (one reminder per line) and shows only those scheduled for today.

File format:

text
2025-03-20: Call dentist
2025-03-21: Submit report
Requirements:

Read the file.

Compare the date part with today’s date.

Print matching reminders.

If the file doesn’t exist, create an empty one with a message.

Extra:
Add a new reminder from user input and save it to the file.

